A '''Sky Trainer''' (Japanese: '''スカイトレーナー''' ''Sky Trainer'') is a type of [[Pokémon Trainer]] introduced in [[Generation VI]]. The class consists of Trainers who specialize in [[Sky Battle]]s. They can be found on top of cliffs or other distant locations that the {{player}} could not naturally reach. Sky Trainers will offer to battle the player once the player moves in front of where they are overlooking.

