==In animation==
[[File:Moria.png|thumb|250px|Moria, a female Sky Trainer in the {{aniseries|XY}}]]
===''Pokémon the Series''===
In {{aniseries|PTS}}, it is shown that Sky Trainers use their flying suits to fly alongside their {{OBP|Pokémon|species}} during Sky Battles.

===={{aniseries|XY}}====
A female Sky Trainer named [[Moria]] appeared in ''[[XY036|Battles in the Sky!]]'', commanding a {{p|Talonflame}}. At the beginning of the episode, she was seen defeating a male Sky Trainer using a {{p|Skarmory}}. Later she also battled {{Ash}} twice. In the first battle, her Talonflame took a rather easy victory over [[Ash's Hawlucha]], while in the second battle, Ash's {{p|Fletchling}} evolved into a {{AP|Fletchinder}} and learned {{m|Flame Charge}} in the middle of the match, resulting in Ash's victory.

A couple of other, unnamed Sky Trainers also appeared in the Sky Battle Center where Ash and {{ashfr}} practiced the basics of Sky Battles.

===={{aniseries|SM}}====
A Sky Trainer appeared in ''[[SM060|Getting a Jump on the Competition!]]'', participating in the [[Pokémon Sled Jump Games]] on [[Mount Lanakila]] with an {{p|Emolga}}.

