==In the manga==
[[File:Y Sky Trainer.png|thumb|175px|Y as a Sky Trainer in Pokémon Adventures]]
===Pokémon Adventures===
{{adv|Y}}, who was first introduced in ''[[PS549|An X-cuse to Come Out and Play]]'', is training to become a Sky Trainer. She chose this career path out of irritation when people expected her to follow in {{kal|Grace|her mother}}'s footsteps and become a {{p|Rhyhorn}} Racer, deciding to do the exact opposite thing and learn to fly.

Later, it is revealed that there was a Sky Trainer school in [[Vaniville Town]], where Y studied at along with her senior, [[Yvette]], who had collected 18 of the {{p|Vivillon}} {{fd|Vivillon|patterns}}.
